    "text": "Figure 3.5 (page 77). 'DPI-H Reference Architecture': the layered view without the goals: point-of-service and functional applications at the top; the government-stewarded DPI-H layer of reusable components and the shared data layer of core registries, REDDHI components starred; the foundational DPI layer at the bottom; and an interoperability column with the information mediator, open standards and integration patterns. At this resolution most of the small text is not legible.",
